<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4948" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάραντος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰμᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαραίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfading,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dom.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					6.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρονομία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2942c
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tralles</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				2.286
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Panticapaeum</span>): neut. pl. as
				Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάραντον, τό</span> (but in Lat.
				<i>amarantus), never-fading flower,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.607e
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Carales</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.229
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλίχρυσον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.57
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενταύρειον μικρόν</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.7
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοκόμη.</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.55
			</span></i>.</div>
